    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13844" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποστερ-ητής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one who withholds,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EE</u>
				1232a15
			</span></i>; esp. <i>one who withholds what is due, a defrauder, cheat,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				344b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				745.7
			</span></i><span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποστερητὴν
				ἀγοράσας ἀγρόν</span> a farm <i>that costs money</i>
			instead of bringing it in, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				109
			</span></i>.</div>
